   "question": "Built-on parcels where the highest KCDC recommended building level (a minimum floor level, NZVD2016, including freeboard) inside the parcel is more than 1 m above the parcel's mean LiDAR ground. A floor-height requirement for rebuilding, not a flood depth.",
